{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where faith is everything - when evil comes for you, you had <i>better</i> say your prayers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056490/extras/5f16075585c156afd4beff3134ee494d.avif?t=1765490634\" alt=\"A blonde nun standing in a busy road of a small rural village. She looks excited.\" width=1280 height=540 /></span>In <strong>Convent Chronicles: Revelation</strong> follow the story of Sister Mary Angelica and the Sisters of Saint Dymphna, as the world opens anew thanks to sweeping changes from the neo-reformation. However, Angelica finds the world outside the convent walls is not the Edenford she remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056490/extras/14720d58ad19bf80b37915eb0b781253.avif?t=1765490634\" alt=\"A seductive woman with purple hair and purple eyes wrapping her arms around a man wearing a grey suit and dark black sunglasses.\" width=1280 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before she knows it, Angelica finds herself thrust into a centuries old conflict, where sinister forces work to undermine the faith of the people and bring forth the complete destruction of Saint Dymphna's Convent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056490/extras/54417298e9714d963b26d9e1d1efd14d.avif?t=1765490634\" alt=\"Three nuns around a table, having a meal. On the left, a red haired nun with green eyes and a white habit with short sleeves looks embarrassed but accepting. On the right, a blonde haired nun with blue eyes wearing a black habit stands, looking welcoming. In the center background, a brown haired nun wearing black rimmed glasses with brown eyes and a black habit sits, looking apprehensive.\" width=1280 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With her sisters by her side, she faces the forces of evil while holding those most important to her closest to her heart. As her world shatters, she prays to hold on to every shard she has left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>3,000</strong> unique full-screen images, bringing the visuals of the story <i>truly</i> to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 chapters, each with <strong>alternate scenes</strong> based on player choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>200</strong> unlockable CGs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>100</strong> unique musical compositions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This product contains scenes of violence, blood, partial nudity, sexual situations, death, and other topics that may be considered disturbing and is intended for mature audiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056490?t=1765490634","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056490?t=1765490634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056490/74142d77b17d6e7ee77f5128924c670d2c8682be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765490634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056490/74142d77b17d6e7ee77f5128924c670d2c8682be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765490634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"de