yes and a white habit with short sleeves looks embarrassed but accepting. On the right, a blonde haired nun with blue eyes wearing a black habit stands, looking welcoming. In the center background, a brown haired nun wearing black rimmed glasses with brown eyes and a black habit sits, looking apprehensive.\" width=1280 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With her sisters by her side, she faces the forces of evil while holding those most important to her closest to her heart. As her world shatters, she prays to hold on to every shard she has left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>3,000</strong> unique full-screen images, bringing the visuals of the story <i>truly</i> to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 chapters, each with <strong>alternate scenes</strong> based on player choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>200</strong> unlockable CGs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>100</strong> unique musical compositions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This product contains scenes of violence, blood, partial nudity, sexual situations, death, and other topics that may be considered disturbing and is intended for mature audiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Angelic Creations"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056490/8f77e6b99bed47bfd8796a32c85b85d8bc56e420/header.jpg?t=1765490634","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Convent Chronicles: Revelation","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8.1/10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core